    "detailed_description": "<i>Nine in Flight</i> is an absurdist mystery for only the most hard-boiled interim junior detectives.<br><br>There are no freebies\u2014no \u201cclick here to cast suspicion\u201d. The player has nothing but their intuition (and a unique corroboration mechanic) to catch lies, solve puzzles, and unravel a cartoonish murder.<br><br><br><strong>THE RUNDOWN</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/94a91589268b5fc0cce8b9a5155ef6f6.poster.avif?t=1723678214\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/94a91589268b5fc0cce8b9a5155ef6f6.webm?t=1723678214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/94a91589268b5fc0cce8b9a5155ef6f6.mp4?t=1723678214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Adventure the accommodations of history\u2019s never-landingest luxury airship on its maiden voyage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/6ba7f6735e1910d5ea9c271cb846ff9c.poster.avif?t=1723678214\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/6ba7f6735e1910d5ea9c271cb846ff9c.webm?t=1723678214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/6ba7f6735e1910d5ea9c271cb846ff9c.mp4?t=1723678214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With branching, interwoven dialogue, learn more than anyone could ever want to know about the types of people who would go on a cruise.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/01ab0121179fb980aa6cd6aa48efa63a.poster.avif?t=1723678214\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/01ab0121179fb980aa6cd6aa48efa63a.webm?t=1723678214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/01ab0121179fb980aa6cd6aa48efa63a.mp4?t=1723678214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Take things that aren\u2019t yours. They belong to the law now. If you\u2019re lucky, they\u2019re clues.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/32e20eae1cc6925402b780c2a1d31490.poster.avif?t=1723678214\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/32e20eae1cc6925402b780c2a1d31490.webm?t=1723678214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/32e20eae1cc6925402b780c2a1d31490.mp4?t=1723678214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Carefully corroborate claims and alibis. Catch suspects lying and totally embarrass them about it\u2014to jail.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/0d43f1c19e6b144dd536ce6e65afd3e1.poster.avif?t=1723678214\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/0d43f1c19e6b144dd536ce6e65afd3e1.webm?t=1723678214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/0d43f1c19e6b144dd536ce6e65afd3e1.mp4?t=1723678214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Test your mental fortitude with challenging puzzles. Regret putting \u201cdetail-oriented\u201d on your r\u00e9sum\u00e9.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/791f1d70fb34e654b0872e93068cd516.poster.avif?t=1723678214\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/791f1d70fb34e654b0872e93068cd516.webm?t=1723678214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996110/extras/791f1d70fb34e654b0872e93068cd516.mp4?t=1723678214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Stylized animated cutscenes deliver shocking revelations. You\u2019ll have more goosebumps than skin.<br><br><br><strong>THE MYSTERY</strong><br>Hand-picked guests enjoy the maiden voyage of the world\u2019s first ever flying cruise\u2014the brainchild of trillionaire Billiam Pocketsworth. <br><br>Deep in the final night, Bill is brutally killed to death, left like a human knife block on the floor of the restaurant kitchen. <br><br>With just one day left before landfall, can the Marshal crack the case with nothing but his savvy, wits, and period-appropriate moustache?",
